    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A heavily plated, treaded frame built to take punishment.</p><p><strong>Size</strong> Medium or Large</p><p><strong>Speeds</strong> land 20 feet</p><p><strong>Attacks</strong> Melee <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> battering ram (shove), Damage 1d6 bludgeoning</p><p><strong>Attribute Modifiers</strong> Str +2, Dex +1, Con +3, Int -4, Wis +2, Cha -1</p><p><strong>Ancestry Hit Points</strong> 10</p><p><strong>Trained Skill</strong> Intimidation</p><p><strong>Senses</strong> Low-light vision (plus the construct base senses: precise vision, imprecise hearing, vague touch)</p><hr /><p><strong>Support Benefit: Tactical Targeting Assistance</strong> Your robot companion assists you in battle. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus on your next attack roll to Strike a foe within the robot companion's melee reach. The bonus lasts until the first time you Strike or until the beginning of your next turn, whichever comes first.</p><p><strong>Advanced Maneuver: Ram Slam</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (Traversal) Your robot companion Strides in a straight line and makes a battering ram Strike. As long as it moved at least 20 feet and successfully hit, the target is pushed back 10 feet. (Requires Advanced Drone feat)</p>"
